<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90402" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσχωσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ,= <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσχωμα Ι, αἱ νῆσοι . . τῆς π.
					σύνδεσμοι γίγνονται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.102
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾶσα [Αἴγυπτος] . . π. οὖσα τοῦ
					Νείλου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mete.</u>
					351b30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				352a4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				353a2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				656.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>process of silting up</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				1.2.29
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				7.3.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>mound raised against</i> a place, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.77
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>ramp of earth</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. [τῷ βωμῷ] κατὰ πρανοῦς γενομένης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					4.8.5
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PRein.</u>
				52b
			</span></i>.<i><span class="en">
				26
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>.</div>
